msgid "Read, compose, and manage cellular SMS messages stored on the SIM card."
msgstr "读取、发送及管理存储于SIM卡中的蜂窝网络短信。"

msgid "SMS Feature is Currently Disabled"
msgstr "短信功能已停用"

msgid "To prevent IoT SIM cards, enterprise telemetry cards, or data-only SIM cards from unexpected billing, network carrier account suspensions, or serial AT buffer deadlocks, the SMS module is disabled by default. In this mode, no background polling or SMS commands will ever touch the cellular modem."
msgstr "为防止物联网卡、企业遥测卡或纯数据流量卡产生异常扣费、运营商风控锁卡或串口缓冲区死锁，短信功能默认处于完全关闭状态。在此模式下，系统绝不向蜂窝模组发送任何短信读取或配置指令。"

